{"id":"vod_sn_37476","vodId":"37476","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"散华礼弥","name_cn":"散华礼弥","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0bebed12f1ec14ae752bdf93f31c880f.jpg"},"summary":"散华礼弥（内田真礼 配音）本该是一个快乐活泼的女孩，可是与亡母过分想象的外貌激发了父亲散华团一郎（石冢运升 配音）超限度的溺爱和束缚，这让礼弥感到痛苦万分，甚至因此而失足从悬崖上摔落而死。没想到，礼弥的死却促成了她和偶然间邂逅的少年降谷千紘（木村良平 配音）之间的一段缘分。为了使爱猫复活，对僵尸极其狂热的降谷研发了一种怪异的药剂，他将这种药剂用在了已死的礼弥身上，没想到，礼弥居然以僵尸的形式重生了。　　就这样，僵尸礼弥顺其自然的成为了降谷家的寄宿者，而为了使礼弥能够重新成为普通的女孩，降谷开始为了研究新的药剂而开始了奔波。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LcUAfZtMEv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YhhCskZR5Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mdudwK6jnS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TmdCXSWeMW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Kifu3RkR1w1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pwLwnjn9At1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qkZeXe6nFc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FAYk8VKmZD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DLF3ZwLf5i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HNh5vR6CKp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Z727feZ0ss1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7ybZ3r5Hna1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:10.220Z"}